					<div id="mw-content-text" class="mw-body-content"><div class="mw-subjectpageheader">
</div><div class="mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output" lang="en" dir="ltr" data-mw-parsoid-version="0.24.0.0-alpha15" data-mw-html-version="2.8.0"><section data-mw-section-id="0" id="mwAQ"><div class="shortdescription nomobile noexcerpt noprint searchaux" style="display:none" about="#mwt1" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAg" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Short description","href":"./Template:Short_description"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Private university in Cuttack, India"}},"i":0}}]}'>Private university in Cuttack, India</div><span class="mw-empty-elt" about="#mwt1"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_with_short_description"/><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Short_description_is_different_from_Wikidata"/></span>
<p class="mw-empty-elt" id="mwAw"><span typeof="mw:Nowiki mw:Transclusion" about="#mwt2" id="mwBA" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Use dmy dates","href":"./Template:Use_dmy_dates"},"params":{"date":{"wt":"September 2019"}},"i":0}}]}'></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Use_dmy_dates_from_September_2019" about="#mwt2" id="mwBQ"/>
<span typeof="mw:Nowiki mw:Transclusion" about="#mwt3" id="mwBg" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Use Indian English","href":"./Template:Use_Indian_English"},"params":{"date":{"wt":"October 2013"}},"i":0}}]}'></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Use_Indian_English_from_October_2013" about="#mwt3"/><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:All_Wikipedia_articles_written_in_Indian_English" about="#mwt3" id="mwBw"/></p>
<span class="mw-empty-elt" about="#mwt4" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwCA" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Infobox university\n ","href":"./Template:Infobox_university"},"params":{"name":{"wt":"Sri Sri University"},"image":{"wt":"Sri_Sri_University_Logo.png"},"established":{"wt":"{{Start date and age|df=y|2009|12|26}}"},"type":{"wt":"[[Private university|Private]]"},"founders":{"wt":"[[Sri Sri Ravi Shankar]]&lt;ref name=\"auto\">{{cite web |url=http://www.srisriuniversity.edu.in/srisriravishankar |title=Sri Sri Ravi Shankar &amp;#124; Sri Sri University |access-date=26 April 2017 |url-status=dead |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20170505114200/http://www.srisriuniversity.edu.in/srisriravishankar |archive-date=5 May 2017 }}&lt;/ref>"},"affiliations":{"wt":"[[University Grants Commission (India)| UGC]]"},"motto":{"wt":"Sathyam Gyanam Anantham Brahma&lt;br />([[Sanskrit]])"},"president":{"wt":"Prof. (Mrs.) Rajita Kulkarni"},"vice_chancellor":{"wt":"Prof. (Dr.) B.R. Sharma&lt;ref>{{Cite web|url=https://srisriuniversity.edu.in/vc-prof-br-sharma/|title=Dr. B.R Sharma &amp;#124; Sri Sri University|accessdate=14 April 2022}}&lt;/ref>"},"coordinates":{"wt":"{{coord|20.4533|85.7974|type:edu|display=inline,title}}"},"location":{"wt":"Godi Sahi, [[Cuttack, Odisha]], India"},"campus":{"wt":"Urban, {{cvt|188|acres}}"},"website":{"wt":"{{url|www.srisriuniversity.edu.in}}"},"footnotes":{"wt":""}},"i":0}}]}'><style data-mw-deduplicate="TemplateStyles:r1358620234" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" about="#mwt5" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Infobox/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""}}'>@media(min-width:640px){.mw-parser-output .infobox{margin-left:1em;float:right;clear:right;width:22em}}.mw-parser-output .infobox-subbox{padding:0;border:none;margin:-3px;width:auto;min-width:100%;font-size:100%;clear:none;float:none;background-color:transparent;color:inherit}.mw-parser-output .infobox-3cols-child{margin:-3px}.mw-parser-output .infobox .navbar{font-size:100%}.mw-parser-output .infobox-hiddenrow,body.skin--responsive.skin--responsive .mw-parser-output .infobox .infobox-hiddenrow{display:none}@media screen{html.skin-theme-clientpref-night .mw-parser-output .infobox-full-data:not(.notheme)>div:not(.notheme)[style]{background:#1f1f23!important;color:#f8f9fa}}@media screen and (prefers-color-scheme:dark){html.skin-theme-clientpref-os .mw-parser-output .infobox-full-data:not(.notheme)>div:not(.notheme)[style]{background:#1f1f23!important;color:#f8f9fa}}@media(min-width:640px){body.skin--responsive .mw-parser-output .infobox-table{display:table!important}body.skin--responsive .mw-parser-output .infobox-table>caption{display:table-caption!important}body.skin--responsive .mw-parser-output .infobox-table>tbody{display:table-row-group}body.skin--responsive .mw-parser-output .infobox-table th,body.skin--responsive .mw-parser-output .infobox-table td{padding-left:inherit;padding-right:inherit}}</style></span><table class="infobox vcard" about="#mwt4"><caption class="infobox-title fn org">Sri Sri University</caption><tbody><tr><td colspan="2" class="infobox-image"><span class="mw-default-size" typeof="mw:File/Frameless"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Sri_Sri_University_Logo.png" class="mw-file-description"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Sri_Sri_University_Logo.png" src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/7/74/Sri_Sri_University_Logo.png/250px-Sri_Sri_University_Logo.png" decoding="async" data-file-width="324" data-file-height="308" data-file-type="bitmap" height="238" width="250" srcset="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/7/74/Sri_Sri_University_Logo.png 2x" class="mw-file-element mw-file-upright" style="--mw-file-upright: 1"/></a></span></td></tr><tr><th scope="row" class="infobox-label" style="padding-right:0.65em;">Motto</th><td class="infobox-data">Sathyam Gyanam Anantham Brahma<br/>(<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sanskrit" title="Sanskrit">Sanskrit</a>)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row" class="infobox-label" style="padding-right:0.65em;">Type</th><td class="infobox-data"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Private_university" title="Private university">Private</a></td></tr><tr><th scope="row" class="infobox-label" style="padding-right:0.65em;">Established</th><td class="infobox-data">26<span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span>December 2009<span class="noprint"><span typeof="mw:Entity">;</span><span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span>16 years ago</span><span style="display:none"><span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span>(<span class="bday dtstart published updated">2009-12-26</span>)</span></td></tr><tr><th scope="row" class="infobox-label" style="padding-right:0.65em;">Founder</th><td class="infobox-data"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sri_Sri_Ravi_Shankar" title="Sri Sri Ravi Shankar" class="mw-redirect">Sri Sri Ravi Shankar</a><sup about="#mwt8" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-auto_1-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"auto"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-auto-1"}}'><a href="#cite_note-auto-1" id="mwCQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwCg"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwCw">[</span>1<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwDA">]</span></span></a></sup></td></tr><tr><th scope="row" class="infobox-label" style="padding-right:0.65em;">Affiliations</th><td class="infobox-data"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/University_Grants_Commission_(India)" title="University Grants Commission (India)"> UGC</a></td></tr><tr><th scope="row" class="infobox-label" style="padding-right:0.65em;"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/University_president" title="University president" class="mw-redirect">President</a></th><td class="infobox-data">Prof. (Mrs.) Rajita Kulkarni</td></tr><tr><th scope="row" class="infobox-label" style="padding-right:0.65em;"><span class="nowrap"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vice-Chancellor" title="Vice-Chancellor" class="mw-redirect">Vice-Chancellor</a></span></th><td class="infobox-data">Prof. (Dr.) B.R. Sharma<sup about="#mwt13" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-2" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-2"}}'><a href="#cite_note-2" id="mwDQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwDg"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwDw">[</span>2<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwEA">]</span></span></a></sup></td></tr><tr><th scope="row" class="infobox-label" style="padding-right:0.65em;">Location</th><td class="infobox-data adr"><div style="display:inline" class="extended-address">Godi Sahi, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cuttack,_Odisha" title="Cuttack, Odisha" class="mw-redirect">Cuttack, Odisha</a>, India</div><span style="display:none" data-plural="0"></span><br/><span class="geo-inline"><style data-mw-deduplicate="TemplateStyles:r1156832818" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" about="#mwt16" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Coordinates/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""}}'>.mw-parser-output .geo-default,.mw-parser-output .geo-dms,.mw-parser-output .geo-dec{display:inline}.mw-parser-output .geo-nondefault,.mw-parser-output .geo-multi-punct,.mw-parser-output .geo-inline-hidden{display:none}.mw-parser-output .longitude,.mw-parser-output .latitude{white-space:nowrap}</style><span class="plainlinks nourlexpansion"><a rel="mw:ExtLink" href="https://geohack.toolforge.org/geohack.php?pagename=Sri_Sri_University&amp;params=20.4533_N_85.7974_E_type:edu" class="external text"><span class="geo-nondefault"><span class="geo-dms" title="Maps, aerial photos, and other data for this location"><span class="latitude">20°27′12″N</span> <span class="longitude">85°47′51″E</span></span></span><span class="geo-multi-punct"><span typeof="mw:Entity">﻿</span> / <span typeof="mw:Entity">﻿</span></span><span class="geo-default"><span class="geo-dec" title="Maps, aerial photos, and other data for this location">20.4533°N 85.7974°E</span><span style="display:none"><span typeof="mw:Entity">﻿</span> / <span class="geo">20.4533; 85.7974</span></span></span></a></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Pages_using_gadget_WikiMiniAtlas"/></span><meta typeof="mw:Extension/indicator" about="#mwt18" id="mwEQ" data-mw='{"name":"indicator","attrs":{"name":"coordinates"},"body":{"extsrc":"&lt;span id=\"coordinates\">[[Geographic coordinate system|Coordinates]]: {{#parsoid\u0000fragment:11}}&lt;span class=\"plainlinks nourlexpansion\">[https://geohack.toolforge.org/geohack.php?pagename=Sri_Sri_University&amp;params=20.4533_N_85.7974_E_type:edu &lt;span class=\"geo-nondefault\">&lt;span class=\"geo-dms\" title=\"Maps, aerial photos, and other data for this location\">&lt;span class=\"latitude\">20°27′12″N&lt;/span> &lt;span class=\"longitude\">85°47′51″E&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class=\"geo-multi-punct\">&amp;#xfeff; / &amp;#xfeff;&lt;/span>&lt;span class=\"geo-default\">&lt;span class=\"geo-dec\" title=\"Maps, aerial photos, and other data for this location\">20.4533°N 85.7974°E&lt;/span>&lt;span style=\"display:none\">&amp;#xfeff; / &lt;span class=\"geo\">20.4533; 85.7974&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>]&lt;/span>[[Category:Pages using gadget WikiMiniAtlas]]&lt;/span>"}}'/><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Coordinates_on_Wikidata"/><span style="display:none" data-plural="1"></span></td></tr><tr><th scope="row" class="infobox-label" style="padding-right:0.65em;">Campus</th><td class="infobox-data"><span class="mw-empty-elt"><style data-mw-deduplicate="TemplateStyles:r1126788409" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" about="#mwt21" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Plainlist/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""}}'>.mw-parser-output .plainlist ol,.mw-parser-output .plainlist ul{line-height:inherit;list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}.mw-parser-output .plainlist ol li,.mw-parser-output .plainlist ul li{margin-bottom:0}</style></span><div class="plainlist"><ul><li>Urban, 188 acres (76<span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span>ha)</li></ul></div></td></tr><tr><th scope="row" class="infobox-label" style="padding-right:0.65em;">Website</th><td class="infobox-data"><span class="url"><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="http://www.srisriuniversity.edu.in" class="external text">www<wbr/>.srisriuniversity<wbr/>.edu<wbr/>.in</a></span></td></tr><tr><td colspan="2" class="infobox-full-data"><a class="mw-kartographer-map notheme mw-kartographer-container center" style="width: 270px; height: 200px;" data-mw-kartographer="mapframe" data-style="osm-intl" data-width="270" data-height="200" data-zoom="13" typeof="mw:Extension/mapframe" about="#mwt22" data-overlays='["_429ef9e3781c434a9a00909c0784d1b735713517"]' id="mwEg" data-mw='{"name":"mapframe","attrs":{"zoom":"13","align":"center","frameless":"1","height":"200","width":"270"},"body":{"extsrc":"[\n{\"properties\":{\"title\":\"Sri Sri University\",\"fill-opacity\":0.1,\"stroke\":\"#FF0000\",\"stroke-width\":2,\"fill\":\"#606060\"},\"type\":\"ExternalData\",\"service\":\"geoshape\",\"ids\":\"Q7586288\"},\n{\"type\":\"Feature\",\"geometry\":{\"coordinates\":[85.7974,20.4533],\"type\":\"Point\"},\"properties\":{\"marker-color\":\"#5E74F3\",\"title\":\"Sri Sri University\",\"marker-symbol\":\"college\"}}\n]"}}'><img src="https://maps.wikimedia.org/img/osm-intl,13,a,a,270x200.png?lang=en&amp;domain=en.wikipedia.org&amp;title=Sri_Sri_University&amp;revid=1357984690&amp;groups=_429ef9e3781c434a9a00909c0784d1b735713517&amp;parser=parsoid" width="270" height="200" decoding="async" srcset="https://maps.wikimedia.org/img/osm-intl,13,a,a,270x200@2x.png?lang=en&amp;domain=en.wikipedia.org&amp;title=Sri_Sri_University&amp;revid=1357984690&amp;groups=_429ef9e3781c434a9a00909c0784d1b735713517&amp;parser=parsoid 2x" typeof="mw:LocalizedAttrs" id="mwEw" alt="Map" data-mw-i18n='{"alt":{"lang":"x-page","key":"kartographer-static-mapframe-alt","params":[]}}'/></a><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Pages_using_infobox_mapframe_without_shape_links_in_Wikidata"/><div class="infobox-caption"></div></td></tr></tbody></table><span class="mw-empty-elt" about="#mwt4"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Pages_using_infobox_university_with_the_affiliations_parameter"/></span>

<p id="mwFA"><b id="mwFQ">Sri Sri University</b> is an <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/India" title="India" id="mwFg">Indian</a> <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Private_university" title="Private university" id="mwFw">private university</a>, based in <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cuttack" title="Cuttack" id="mwGA">Cuttack</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Odisha" title="Odisha" id="mwGQ">Odisha</a>, established on 26 December 2009. The university came into operation in the year 2012.<sup about="#mwt26" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-3" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-3"}}'><a href="#cite_note-3" id="mwGg"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwGw"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwHA">[</span>3<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwHQ">]</span></span></a></sup> At present, the university is offering different courses in areas of <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Management" title="Management" id="mwHg">management</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Architecture" title="Architecture" id="mwHw">architecture</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Humanities" title="Humanities" id="mwIA">humanities</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Agriculture" title="Agriculture" id="mwIQ">agriculture</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Health" title="Health" id="mwIg">health</a> and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wellness_(alternative_medicine)" title="Wellness (alternative medicine)" id="mwIw">wellness</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Science" title="Science" id="mwJA">science</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Literature" title="Literature" id="mwJQ">literature</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Osteopathy" title="Osteopathy" id="mwJg">osteopathy</a> and performing &amp; fine arts.</p>

<meta property="mw:PageProp/toc" id="mwJw" data-mw='{"autoGenerated":true}'/></section><section data-mw-section-id="1" id="mwKA" aria-labelledby="Founder"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="Founder">Founder</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Sri_Sri_University&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1" title="Edit section: Founder"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mwKQ"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sri_Sri_Ravi_Shankar" title="Sri Sri Ravi Shankar" class="mw-redirect" id="mwKg">Sri Sri Ravi Shankar</a> is the founder of Sri Sri University. Popularly known as Sri Sri, he has been an advocate of India's ancient traditions, scientific knowledge and spiritual heritage.<sup about="#mwt27" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-auto_1-1" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"auto"}}'><a href="#cite_note-auto-1" id="mwKw"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwLA"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwLQ">[</span>1<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwLg">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="2" id="mwLw" aria-labelledby="History"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="History">History</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Sri_Sri_University&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2" title="Edit section: History"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mwMA">On 22 February 2012, Sri Sri University was notified by the Higher Education Department of the Government of Odisha as a legal entity after clearing a High Power Committee (HPC) scrutiny of its infrastructure, academic, regulatory, financial and manpower preparedness. The notification has featured in an extraordinary issue of Government of Odisha Gazette.</p>

<section data-mw-section-id="3" id="mwMQ" aria-labelledby="Statutory_approvals"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="Statutory_approvals">Statutory approvals</h3><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Sri_Sri_University&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3" title="Edit section: Statutory approvals"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mwMg">The university has received approval from the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Government_of_Odisha" title="Government of Odisha" id="mwMw">Government of Odisha</a>, the national <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/University_Grants_Commission_(India)" title="University Grants Commission (India)" id="mwNA">University Grants Commission</a>,<sup about="#mwt28" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-4" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-4"}}'><a href="#cite_note-4" id="mwNQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwNg"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwNw">[</span>4<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwOA">]</span></span></a></sup> <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/All_India_Council_for_Technical_Education" title="All India Council for Technical Education" id="mwOQ">All India Council for Technical Education</a>,<sup about="#mwt29" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-5" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-5"}}'><a href="#cite_note-5" id="mwOg"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwOw"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwPA">[</span>5<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwPQ">]</span></span></a></sup> <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Indian_Council_of_Agricultural_Research" title="Indian Council of Agricultural Research" id="mwPg">Indian Council of Agricultural Research</a><sup about="#mwt30" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-6" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-6"}}'><a href="#cite_note-6" id="mwPw"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwQA"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwQQ">[</span>6<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwQg">]</span></span></a></sup> and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Council_of_Architecture" title="Council of Architecture" id="mwQw">Council of Architecture</a><sup about="#mwt31" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-7" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-7"}}'><a href="#cite_note-7" id="mwRA"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwRQ"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwRg">[</span>7<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwRw">]</span></span></a></sup> to offer its degree programmes. As an independent university, Sri Sri University is also authorised to offer new courses, as per the Sri Sri University Act 2009.</p>

</section></section><section data-mw-section-id="4" id="mwSA" aria-labelledby="Awards"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="Awards">Awards</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Sri_Sri_University&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4" title="Edit section: Awards"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mwSQ">Sri Sri University's focus on <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sustainable_living" title="Sustainable living" id="mwSg">sustainable living</a>, emphasis on synthesis of ancient and modern <sup about="#mwt34" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-8" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-8"}}'><a href="#cite_note-8" id="mwSw"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwTA"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwTQ">[</span>8<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwTg">]</span></span></a></sup> along with innovation in teaching learning process have been appreciated and received recognition.,<sup about="#mwt37" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-9" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-9"}}'><a href="#cite_note-9" id="mwTw"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwUA"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwUQ">[</span>9<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwUg">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt40" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-10" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-10"}}'><a href="#cite_note-10" id="mwUw"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwVA"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwVQ">[</span>10<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwVg">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<ul id="mwVw"><li id="mwWA">Environment Friendly Green Campus Award by District Administration, Cuttack, 2016</li>
<li id="mwWQ">'Prakruti Mitra Award 2016' by Minister – Forest &amp; Environment</li>
<li id="mwWg">'Sri Sri University as the Trend setting synthesizer of traditional and global outlook' by <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ASSOCHAM" title="ASSOCHAM" id="mwWw">ASSOCHAM</a>, 2017</li>
<li id="mwXA">Best Innovative University Award-Second National Education Summit and Educational Excellence Awards 2017</li>
<li id="mwXQ">Nominated for Non-Violence Award by Non-Violence Project India Foundation, 2018</li>
<li id="mwXg">‘Green U Award 2019’ and ‘Inspiring Climate Educator Award 2019’ for bringing Nature into Higher Education at the National Green Mentors Conference, Ahmedabad.</li></ul>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="5" id="mwXw" aria-labelledby="Campus"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="Campus">Campus</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Sri_Sri_University&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5" title="Edit section: Campus"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mwYA">The campus houses the admin block, academic block, computer lab, library, seminar halls, practise halls, amphitheatre, hostels, Vidya (skill training centre), dining hall and cafeteria. The academic block houses classrooms, tutorial centres and a student activity centre. The university offers sports facilities including a gym, basketball court, lawn tennis court, volleyball court and a cricket ground.
<sup about="#mwt43" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-11" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-11"}}'><a href="#cite_note-11" id="mwYQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwYg"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwYw">[</span>11<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwZA">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<section data-mw-section-id="6" id="mwZQ" aria-labelledby="Student_clubs"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="Student_clubs">Student clubs</h3><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Sri_Sri_University&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6" title="Edit section: Student clubs"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mwZg">There are currently 16 clubs dedicated to different activities.<sup about="#mwt46" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-12" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-12"}}'><a href="#cite_note-12" id="mwZw"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwaA"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwaQ">[</span>12<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwag">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

</section></section><section data-mw-section-id="7" id="mwaw" aria-labelledby="Vocational_training"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="Vocational_training">Vocational training</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Sri_Sri_University&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7" title="Edit section: Vocational training"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mwbA">The university has started a vocational program in collaboration with <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Larsen_&amp;_Toubro" title="Larsen &amp; Toubro" id="mwbQ">Larsen &amp; Toubro</a> under its <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Corporate_Social_Responsibility" title="Corporate Social Responsibility" class="mw-redirect" id="mwbg">Corporate Social Responsibility</a> commitments. All students of this vocational program are employed by L&amp;T in their domestic and international projects.<sup about="#mwt49" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-13" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-13"}}'><a href="#cite_note-13" id="mwbw"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwcA"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwcQ">[</span>13<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwcg">]</span></span></a></sup> To begin with the university had started only bar bending and masonry skill programs. But presently new programs like driving, tailoring and other vocations have been included.</p>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="8" id="mwcw" aria-labelledby="Notable_alumni"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="Notable_alumni">Notable alumni</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Sri_Sri_University&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8" title="Edit section: Notable alumni"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<ul id="mwdA"><li id="mwdQ"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Raghavan_Seetharaman" title="Raghavan Seetharaman" id="mwdg">Raghavan Seetharaman</a> achieved a doctorate by submitting a Research Thesis on 'Green Banking and Sustainability' at Sri Sri University.<sup about="#mwt52" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-14" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-14"}}'><a href="#cite_note-14" id="mwdw"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mweA"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mweQ">[</span>14<span class="cite-bracket" id="mweg">]</span></span></a></sup> He has also received <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pravasi_Bharatiya_Samman" title="Pravasi Bharatiya Samman" id="mwew">Pravasi Bharatiya Samman</a> Awards-2017, the highest honour conferred on overseas Indians, from the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/President_of_India" title="President of India" id="mwfA">President of India</a>.</li></ul>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="9" id="mwfQ" aria-labelledby="NIRF_Rankings"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="NIRF_Rankings">NIRF Rankings</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Sri_Sri_University&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9" title="Edit section: NIRF Rankings"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mwfg">Sri Sri University Overall ranking by National Institutional Ranking Framework Innovation is 51 out of 312 colleges in India in 2023 (2nd in Odisha). <sup about="#mwt55" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-15" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-15"}}'><a href="#cite_note-15" id="mwfw"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwgA"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwgQ">[</span>15<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwgg">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="10" id="mwgw" aria-labelledby="IIRF_Rankings"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="IIRF_Rankings">IIRF Rankings</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Sri_Sri_University&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10" title="Edit section: IIRF Rankings"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mwhA">Sri Sri University Overall ranking by IIRF is 11 out of 171 colleges in India in 2023 and it was 8 out of 161 colleges in India in 2022. Sri Sri University Architecture ranking by IIRF is 37 out of 45 colleges in India in 2024 and it was 36 out of 44 colleges in India in 2023.<sup about="#mwt58" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-16" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-16"}}'><a href="#cite_note-16" id="mwhQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwhg"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwhw">[</span>16<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwiA">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="11" id="mwiQ" aria-labelledby="References"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="References">References</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Sri_Sri_University&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11" title="Edit section: References"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
